  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"left\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"right\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML page with labeled inputs, operation select, calculate button, and result output."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #16213e;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  border: 4px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f3460;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: #e94560;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\ninput,\nselect {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  border: 3px solid #533483;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus,\nselect:focus {\n  border-color: #e94560;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.3);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #fff;\n  border: 3px solid #533483;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff5c77;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #e94560;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  background: #c73550;\n}\n\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  border: 3px solid #533483;\n  color: #e94560;\n  min-height: 64px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0f3460;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  output {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-themed stylesheet with responsive layout and interactive states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  const rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  const operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function showError() {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n    const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n\n    if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '') {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const left = Number(leftRaw);\n    const right = Number(rightRaw);\n\n    if (!isFinite(left) || !isFinite(right)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const op = operationSelect.value;\n    let result;\n\n    switch (op) {\n      case 'add':\n        result = left + right;\n        break;\n      case 'subtract':\n        result = left - right;\n        break;\n      case 'multiply':\n        result = left * right;\n        break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (right === 0) {\n          showError();\n          return;\n        }\n        result = left / right;\n        break;\n      default:\n        showError();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!isFinite(result)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    resultOutput.textContent = String(result);\n  }\n\n  calculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n  [leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(function (el) {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        calculate();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();",
      "description": "Calculation logic with validation, error handling, and event listeners."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-styled calculator that performs basic arithmetic on two numbers. Runs fully offline in any modern browser with no dependencies, packages, or network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Inputs: Left and Right numbers (supports negative values)\n- Operations: Add, Subtract, Multiply, Divide\n- Keyboard accessible: all controls are labeled, tab-navigable, and Enter triggers calculation\n- Robust validation: empty, non-numeric, non-finite, and division-by-zero inputs display exactly `Error`\n- Result area shows only the numeric result (no label), initialized to `0`\n- Responsive layout works down to 360px wide\n- Pixel aesthetic: blocky borders, monospace system fonts, cohesive 4-color palette\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in the **Left number** field (negatives allowed, e.g. `-5`).\n3. Choose an **Operation** from the dropdown.\n4. Enter a number in the **Right number** field.\n5. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any input).\n6. The result appears in the output area below the button.\n\n## Error Handling\n\nThe output displays exactly `Error` when:\n- Either input is empty\n- Either input is not a finite number (e.g., `abc`, `Infinity`, `NaN`)\n- Division by zero is attempted\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` — calculation logic and event handling\n\n## Notes\n\n- No external assets, iframes, or server code.\n- All paths are relative.\n- Total implementation is under 200 lines.",
      "description": "Project documentation with usage and feature list."
    }
  ]
